 and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video, then producing Marketplace-Optimized Videos & Images, that increase ‘Add-to-Cart’ by building customer trust, ready to get listed on Amazon, Shopify & more.\n\nFrom Concept to Final Cut, we create Ad Films - Our custom production tech-stack helps our creative team with realistic environments, lifelike AI humans, multi-language voiceovers and dialogues. No sets. No actors. Just Platform-Optimized Films ready for YouTube, Meta, TV, OTT & more.\n\n#AIAdFilm #AICommercial #AIVideoProduction #AIGeneratedVideo #GenerativeAI\n#CGICommercial #CGIAd #VFXCommercial #VFXAd\n#VirtualProduction #NoShootAd #VirtualAd\n#FutureOfAdvertising #AIInMarketing #DigitalAdvertising\n#BrandFilm #AdFilm #ProductAd #3DCommercial", "channel_id": "UCjK5oJeQtU8o7gE89FLAMZw", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjK5oJeQtU8o7gE89FLAMZw", "duration": 25, "view_count": 16, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EYaNHag-hf8", "categories": ["Film & Animation"], "tags": [], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "channel": "V4B-ai : We Create Videos Without Shoot ", "channel_follower_count": 98, "uploader": "V4B-ai : We Create Videos Without Shoot ", "uploader_id": "@v4b-ai", "uploader_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@v4b-ai", "upload_date": "20260401", "timestamp": 1775035793, "availability": "public", "webpage_url_basename": "watch", "webpage_url_domain": "youtube.com", "extractor": "youtube", "extractor_key": "Youtube", "display_id": "EYaNHag-hf8", "fulltitle": "Perfume eCom Optimized Product Video Created Without Shoot Using AI , 3D & VFX.", "duration_string": "25", "is_live": false, "was_live": false, "epoch": 1784031362, 